      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Welcome back to Domashniy Arest! After a long, despairing night of drinking following the slanderous attacks on his family honor, mayoral candidate Ivan Samsonov wakes up with a terrible hangover on a table in a dingy neighbourhood bar. The unsympathetic bartender wants to close up and orders Ivan to clear out. Let's listen to the scene in Russian first.",
      "gap": 0.8
    },
    {
